PETSELFTEST1
# V2-09 "put the pet to sleep": cancel once from the home rail, then
# sleep via PWR, power off through the PMIC and wake by RTC alarm.
# Counted from "mark begin" (see tools/selftest_report.py).
# expect min:PET_SLEEP_REQUESTED 2
# expect min:PET_SLEEP_SHOWN 2
# expect min:PET_SLEEP_CANCELLED 1
# expect min:alarm_s=45 1
# expect min:armed=1 1
# expect min:woke_by_alarm=1 1
# expect min:reason=alarm_wake 1
# expect none:PET_SLEEP_POWEROFF_RETURNED 0
# expect none:PET_SELFTEST_ABORT 0
# Quiet prompts while testing (RAM only, this boot).
volume 15
wait 20000
pet
wait 7000
# Normalize restored pet state to "home, neutral".
tap press 7000
hold press 1500 7000
mark begin
# Rail: Story(1) -> Sleep(4), press, then cancel inside the 3 s window.
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap down 2500
tap press 8000
tap up 7000
# PWR: sleep, power off, RTC alarm wakes the board 45 s later.
alarm 45
tap pwr 30000
end
